# [DJI] 2024-09-29, brandon.hao, patch id: 50751: ENH: UVC: improve mjpeg and h264 screen distortion issues
# [DJI] 2024-10-09, brandon.hao, patch id: 50936: ENH: UVC: solve macos black screen with usb3.0
# [DJI] 2024-10-15, bryant.wang, patch id: 51332: ENH: delete mass_storage.1
# [DJI] 2024-11-15, brandon.hao, patch id:53300, ENH: add uvc 25fps enum
# [DJI] 2025-01-07, brandon.hao, patch id:56415, ENH: set usb product config by different product sh
# [DJI] 2025-01-27, brandon.hao, patch id:58031, ENH: adjust usb services boot order
# [DJI] 2025-02-20, brandon.hao, patch id:59392, ENH: set msc lun by product
# [DJI] 2025-03-20, brandon.hao, patch id:61736, ENH: config usb-storage delay_usb by product
# [DJI] 2025-06-21, brandon.hao, patch id:69881, ENH: set peripheral before restart usb service
